>>>>>> you are looking for something with property an answer satisfies
>>>>>> everyone,
>>>>>> but what is it that you look for? the answer, everyone? I think this
>>>>>> is an
>>>>>> unnecessarily complicated way to deal with {sisku}.
>>>>>>
>>>>>> Jorge
